p>This was a marked downturn from his outing at Silverstone just three weeks ...</p><a href=\"https://www.autosport.com/motogp/news/what-was-different-about-jorge-martins-struggles-in-aragon-gp/10851280/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk\">Keep reading</a>","contentLength":403,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-4.motorsport.com/images/amp/YvKBGlZ6/s6/jorge-martin-aprilia-racing-te-2.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"Packer and Parkin win mammoth Snetterton Roadsports races","url":"https://www.autosport.com/national/news/packer-and-parkin-win-mammoth-snetterton-roadsports-races/10851257/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&utm_term=News&utm_content=uk","date":1788256277,"author":"","guid":464,"unread":true,"content":"","contentLength":0,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-1.motorsport.com/images/amp/2jEAQQz0/s6/jonathan-packer-5-won-the-b-d-.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"How Ferrari can \"push until the end\" with F1 2026 upgrades, and why it will","url":"https://www.autosport.com/f1/news/how-ferrari-can-push-until-the-end-with-f1-2026-upgrades-and-why-it-will/10851266/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&utm_term=News&utm_content=uk","date":1788252252,"author":"","guid":463,"unread":true,"content":"","contentLength":0,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-7.motorsport.com/images/amp/2y7Q3am6/s6/charles-leclerc-ferrari-2.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"Mario Andretti and Jacky Ickx: A friendship that has endured for almost 60 years","url":"https://www.autosport.com/wec/news/mario-andretti-and-jacky-ickx-a-friendship-that-has-endured-for-almost-60-years/10851260/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&utm_term=News&utm_content=uk","date":1788250186,"author":"","guid":462,"unread":true,"content":"","contentLength":0,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-3.motorsport.com/images/amp/01QNQeZ0/s6/winners-mario-andretti-and-jac.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"Why Quartararo refuses to be Yamaha’s “test rider” as he reaches breaking point","url":"https://www.autosport.com/motogp/news/fabio-quartararo-refuses-to-be-yamahas-test-rider-as-he-reaches-breaking-point/10850997/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&utm_term=News&utm_content=uk","date":1788183004,"author":"","guid":461,"unread":true,"content":"Fabio Quartararo says he will no longer help Yamaha with development work pertaining to the 2027 MotoGP season after being denied a chance to test Pirelli’s new tyres.The 2021 champion made that comment following last weekend’s Aragon Grand Prix, where he felt he was reduced to the role of a “test rider” as Yamaha evaluated several new components.<p>Quartararo is leaving Yamaha after ...</p><a href=\"https://www.autosport.com/motogp/news/fabio-quartararo-refuses-to-be-yamahas-test-rider-as-he-reaches-breaking-point/10850997/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk\">Keep reading</a>","contentLength":407,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-7.motorsport.com/images/amp/Y9lNoDP2/s6/fabio-quartararo-yamaha-factor-3.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"The underlying upgrade that boosted McLaren's performance jump","url":"https://www.autosport.com/f1/news/the-underlying-upgrade-that-boosted-mclarens-performance-jump/10850982/?utm_source=RSS&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=RSS-ALL&utm_term=News&utm_content=uk","date":1788176470,"author":"","guid":460,"unread":true,"content":"","contentLength":0,"flags":null,"enclosureUrl":"https://cdn-1.motorsport.com/images/amp/6DGgGDVY/s6/i-nuovi-cerchi-mclaren-introdo.jpg","enclosureMime":"","commentsUrl":null},{"title":"Ogier apologises to FIA and Paraguay presidents for \"out of line interaction\"","url":"https://www.autosport.com/wrc/news/ogier-apologises-to-fia-and-paraguay-presi